

Name:           cereal
Version:        1.3.2
Release:        1
Summary:        A header-only C++11 serialization library
License:        BSD-3-Clause AND BSL-1.0 AND Zlib AND MIT AND (MIT OR BSL-1.0)
URL:            https://github.com/USCiLab/cereal
Source0:        cereal-1.3.2.tar.gz

BuildRequires:  boost-devel
BuildRequires:  cmake

%description
cereal is a header-only C++11 serialization library. cereal takes arbitrary
data types and reversibly turns them into different representations, such as
compact binary encodings, XML, or JSON. cereal was designed to be fast,
light-weight, and easy to extend - it has no external dependencies and can be
easily bundled with other code or used standalone.

%package devel
Summary:        Development headers and libraries for cereal
Provides:       cereal-static = 1.3.2-1

%description devel
cereal is a header-only C++11 serialization library. cereal takes arbitrary
data types and reversibly turns them into different representations, such as
compact binary encodings, XML, or JSON. cereal was designed to be fast,
light-weight, and easy to extend - it has no external dependencies and can be
easily bundled with other code or used standalone.

This package contains development headers and libraries for the cereal library

%prep
%setup -q

%build
mkdir build
(cd build && cmake .. -DSKIP_PORTABILITY_TEST=ON -DWITH_WERROR=OFF -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr && /bin/make -O -j20)

%install
(cd build && 
  /bin/make \
        DESTDIR=/home/toolchain/rpmbuild/BUILDROOT/cereal-1.3.2-1.x86_64 \
        INSTALL_ROOT=/home/toolchain/rpmbuild/BUILDROOT/cereal-1.3.2-1.x86_64 \
  install  
  rm -f /home/toolchain/rpmbuild/BUILDROOT/cereal-1.3.2-1.x86_64/usr/share/info/dir 
  find /home/toolchain/rpmbuild/BUILDROOT/cereal-1.3.2-1.x86_64 -regex ".*\.la$" | xargs rm -f -- 
  find /home/toolchain/rpmbuild/BUILDROOT/cereal-1.3.2-1.x86_64 -regex ".*\.a$" | xargs rm -f --)

%files devel
%license LICENSE
/usr/include/cereal
/usr/lib64/cmake/cereal
